WEBVTT

00:12:00.216 --> 00:12:05.021
It might just be some kid
at your grandson's school,

00:12:05.054 --> 00:12:06.489
or it might be your daughter.

00:12:07.457 --> 00:12:09.859
Either way, you have to be prepared.

00:12:11.227 --> 00:12:13.896
My father didn't think
it had anything to do with him.

00:12:14.631 --> 00:12:15.765
Guess what?

00:12:16.733 --> 00:12:17.900
It did.

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.068
(Laughter)

00:12:19.936 --> 00:12:22.338
If you are on this earth,

00:12:23.206 --> 00:12:25.775
you are part of the trans story.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.712
You need to be ready to be Leah.